productDescription = "APX NEXT<sup>TM</sup>is the next-generation, mission-critical communication tool built on the proven reliability of the APX series. It introduces advanced features specifically for public safety professionals. Designed to military-grade standards for maximum toughness, its user interface is intentionally simple and effective, allowing seamless operation with or without gloves in any extreme environment—be it heat, rain, or snow. The built-in broadband connectivity enables top-notch application services:SmartConnectautomatically switches between LMR and LTE to extend radio communication beyond the boundaries of the radio system, so users can concentrate on their mission and not worry about coverage.SmartLocatelets dispatchers see where everyone under their care is, so they can stay focused on critical situations.SmartMappingtakes the map that dispatchers are looking at and displays it on the screen of APX NEXT, so users can know where their team is at in seconds.SmartIncidentprovides field users with immediate access to CAD incident data directly on their device. This includes the ability to update their status, view floor plans, and access information regarding hazards and premises. This CAD-focused information is sourced directly from your agency's CAD system, offering a critical secondary source of information when users are away from their vehicles.SmartMessagingis a secure and convenient way to share texts, images, videos and voice notes across an extended team.RadioCentral, the cloud based provisioning system also makes it possible to prepare radios before they even arrive and SmartProgrammingallows for radio updates to be delivered over broadband regardless of geographic location, giving radio system owners unprecedented speed and convenience of managing their radio fleets.SmartVideois designed for SVX users to offload critical video to CommandCentral DEMS via the APX NEXT’s LTE. It also allows for users to livestream into CommandCentral Aware via the LTE in APX NEXT.If this is the first time you are quoting APX NEXT to this customer or are quoting a new application service to this customer , consult your Pre-Sales Engineer to assess the need for SI Services to program APX NEXT radios and enable the customer system to support the required application services.";

